## new order
posted #1 request W1 implementer → reviewer: W1 work @ 4db127f545c5
handoff: no session has reviewer now, so this waits until the operator gives one that role; tell the operator.
posted #2 claim W1 reviewer → -: claimed #1
# 1.2 s later, a second claim, as a claim slow to check would be:
exists #2 claim W1 reviewer → -: claimed #1
quiet_after: 1s, after the claims
# wait --for implementer --timeout 4s, its stderr:
